    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824170/extras/4a1caaafaa7b8f4922bda0a510b7920d.avif?t=1715973468\" width=600 height=500 /></span><br>Alien toddler Jumpy has crashed and needs your help!<br>Join Jumpy on his adventure to recover his UFO wreckage, repair it and return to his home planet. Use tools like the shovel, the metal detector or the hammer and puzzle and jump through an enchanting and cozy world full of floating islands.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824170/extras/d6962416ecd27ca92133fec9860a38e5.poster.avif?t=1715973468\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824170/extras/d6962416ecd27ca92133fec9860a38e5.webm?t=1715973468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824170/extras/d6962416ecd27ca92133fec9860a38e5.mp4?t=1715973468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824170/extras/75a0ab7c2e8b71fbaad5d8b71abdf9c5.poster.avif?t=1715973468\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824170/extras/75a0ab7c2e8b71fbaad5d8b71abdf9c5.webm?t=1715973468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824170/extras/75a0ab7c2e8b71fbaad5d8b71abdf9c5.mp4?t=1715973468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824170/extras/4b6318a9a623ad3f886fb60b5ebe0438.avif?t=1715973468\" width=600 h